  "prefLabel": "We 203.04 Investigations by the Department",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 203.04 Investigations by the Department. Upon investigation and recommendation of the department, the board shall consider refusal, suspension or revocation as provided by RSA 482-B:8,I and We 203.02.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-B, eff 6-13-08, EXPIRED: 6-13-16",
